  "text": "\n\n\n\n\n        ««  Shadow Hearts  »»                                   [A-1-12]\n____________________________________________________________________________\n\\\\\\\\¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\\\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\                             NPC Library                             \\\\\\\\\n  \\\\\\\\_____________________________________________________________________\\\\\\\\\n   ¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\n\nListed here are all of the important NPC's in the game that show up in your\nlibrary, in order of their entries.\n\n\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n      ***   THIS SECTION CONTAINS SPOILERS. READ AT YOUR OWN RISK.   ***\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|  01-A  |           Roger Bacon          |   Dark    |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|   A British warlock who uses powerful magic. He is calm, collected, and     |\n|   calls himself Roger Bacon. If that is true, he is the legendary           |\n|   alchemist, but...                                                         |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|  01-B  |          Albert Simon          |   Dark    |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|   He calls himself by his master's name, the legendary alchemist Roger      |\n|   Bacon, and attempts to bring new order to this world. He has the          |\n|   knowledge to do so.                                                       |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|   02   |            Fox Face            |   Dark    |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|   A mysterious man who steps out of the world of nightmare into the real    |\n|   world. He appears when the Malice Meter peaks. He wears the coat of the   |\n|   Japanese Army.                                                            |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|   03   |        Wanderer Meiyuan        |   Light   |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|   An expert acupuncturist. He raises weapon proficiency. Strange, but he    |\n|   is the master of this field. He likes good-looking men.                   |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|   04   |   Lt. Col. Yoshiko Kawashima   |   Wind    |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|   Called a star and the hero of the continent, She will do anything to      |\n|   achieve her goal. An expert marksman.                                     |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|   05   |             Dehuai             |   Fire    |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|   An Adept who lives in Kuihai Tower and protects Shanghai from external    |\n|   attacks. He plans on ruling and turning Shanghai into a city of demons.   |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|   06   |              Puppy             |   Fire    |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|   A stray dog in Fengtian. Friendly and looks very smart. A mixed breed.    |\n|   He follows the main characters around, which is cute but somehow          |\n|   peculiar.                                                                 |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|   07   |              Anne              |   Light   |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|   The main character's mother. A beautiful Russian woman. Many details of   |\n|   her life remain a mystery. Dehuai's demon took her life before her        |\n|   son's eyes.                                                               |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|   08   |           Young Yuri           |   Dark    |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|   The main character as a young boy. He lived peacefully with his Russian   |\n|   mother and Japanese father, but one day, his body began to change in      |\n|   abnormal ways...                                                          |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|   09   |        Colonel Ben Hyuga       |   Dark    |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|   A Japanese colonel who disappeared during a secret mission on the         |\n|   continent in 1900. Rumored to have special powers.                        |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|   10   |           Sea Mother           |   Water   |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|   She performs rites to ward off evil in a small fishing village in         |\n|   Dalian. She tries to protect the village people from a young girl's       |\n|   curse. She used to be a beautiful woman.                                  |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|   11   |              Li Li             |   Dark    |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|   A girl from Dalian who lost her father in a tragic accident and was       |\n|   forced to lead a cursed life. She took her own life out of scorn for      |\n|   the village and the ocean god.                                            |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|   12   |       Sergeant Seiji Kato      |   Earth   |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|   An unlucky geographer who joins Kawashima's secret mission. He takes      |\n|   great interest in the world of dark magic during the mission.             |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|   13   |        Wugui of Kowloon        |   Dark    |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|   Former employee of Zhen's bar. He gained demonic powers by joining        |\n|   forces with Dehuai. He now uses that power to his own end by committing   |\n|   crimes all over the continent.                                            |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|   14   |          Zhongyun Zhen         |   Wind    |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|   A hero who fought against Dehuai 15 years ago in Shanghai. He still       |\n|   remembers is old colleague, Colonel Hyuga. His health has declined        |\n|   since he gave up his bar.                                                 |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|   15   |     Lieutenant Ken Suketani    |   Light   |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|   A young lieutenant who admires Kawashima. He doesn't look like a spy,     |\n|   but he is in charge of investigating Dehuai. A straight-arrow soldier.    |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|   16   |             Qiuhua             |   Light   |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|   Zhen's daughter and a master of the Chinese fiddle. Her father's past     |\n|   conflict with Dehuai haunts her to this day. She met Colonel Hyuga and    |\n|   the quack oracle when she was young.                                      |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|   17   |         Master Xiaofang        |   Earth   |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|   A cat transformed into human with Xifa's Taoist Magic. He is learning     |\n|   language and customs under Xifa. His street-wise personality hints at     |\n|   his stray-cat past.                                                       |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|   18   |           Master Xifa          |   Water   |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|   The grand master of Taoist Arts said to travel on clouds and walk the     |\n|   depth of the ocean. He has gone into hiding in an underground temple,     |\n|   but the story has not been confirmed.                                     |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|   19   |       Major Kaoru Kutsugi      |   Wind    |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|   An elite soldier from the army's investigative division. He accuses       |\n|   Kawashima and Kato of revolting against the army and pursues them.        |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|   20   |              Terry             |   Earth   |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|   Item shop owner of Bistritz. He visits Prague to hire two renowned        |\n|   exorcists to run the demons out of his village. He is a loving husband    |\n|   and father.                                                               |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|   21   |            Michelle            |   Water   |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|   Terry's beautiful and loving wife. She has spent her entire life in       |\n|   Bistritz, and never been outside.                                         |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|   22   |              Nina              |   Wind    |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|   Terry and Michelle's daughter. An honest young girl who tries to accept   |\n|   her father's death and protect her mother. She punches out men who        |\n|   attempt to date her mother.                                               |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|   23   |              Kevin             |   Fire    |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|   He became the mayor of Bistritz with money. He performs strange           |\n|   experiments, and stalks Terry's wife, Michelle.                           |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|   24   |           Arcane Olga          |   Dark    |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|   An old woman with strong mystical strength. Her power impressed the       |\n|   quack oracle. Involved in many mysterious incidents all over Europe.      |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|   25   |          Father Doyle          |   Wind    |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|    A priest in Rouen who knows the truth behind Father Elliot's murder.     |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|   26   |             Joshua             |   Water   |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|   A member of the London Rats. An expert pickpocket and a fast runner. He   |\n|   looks up to his leader and hopes to grow up like him.                     |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|   27   |              Chris             |   Earth   |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|   An orphan girl who lives on the streets of London. She refuses the help   |\n|   of adults and chooses to live with her pack. She has romantic feelings    |\n|   for the leader.                                                           |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|   28   |             Sharon             |   Light   |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|   Joshua's \"girlfriend\". The youngest member of the London Rats. She        |\n|   remains optimistic even after her parents abandoned her. She wants        |\n|   Joshua to marry her.                                                      |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|   29   |              Jack              |   Water   |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|   A young doctor with multiple personalities and an Oedipus complex. He     |\n|   has been experimenting on animals since his mother's death. He is also    |\n|   a suspect in recent murders.                                              |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|   30   |         Viscount Rausan        |   Fire    |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|   A Friar Knight inquisitor who belongs to the Order of the Temple          |\n|   Knights. He is called the Last Great General, and loves to torture        |\n|   people.                                                                   |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|   31   |         Koudelka Iasant        |   Fire    |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|   A mysterious woman who knows the truth behind the string of incidents.    |\n|   She disappeared after the Nemeton Monastery went up in flames. She has    |\n|   strong mystical strength.                                                 |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|   32   |          Father Elliot         |   Light   |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|   A priest renowned for his exorcising skills. He died in an alley of       |\n|   Rouen. The heroine's father, and a man who could have shed some light     |\n|   on the string of incidents.                                               |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'\n\n\n.————————.————————————————————————————————.———————————.\n|   33   |           Roger Bacon          |   Earth   |\n.————————'————————————————————————————————'———————————'———————————————————————.\n|   A legendary alchemist who became immortal. He leaves traces of himself    |\n|   wherever he goes, but he has not been seen. If he is indeed alive, then   |\n|   he is more than 400 years old.                                            |\n'—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————'"
}